  rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/v3-NullFlavor#ASKU> .

<https://w3id.org/fair-genomes/ontology/Biomarker_Subtype_Physiological_Temporarily_unavailable_(NAV,_nullflavor)>
